//zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷077"}}},{"id":"sun-chen","zh":"孫綝","en":"Sun Chen","title":{"zh":"丞相、大將軍","en":"Chancellor, General-in-Chief"},"p":"sun-jing","b":231,"d":258,"far":{"zh":"曾孫（峻從弟）","en":"great-grandson (Jun's cousin)"},"kin":{"s":"孫綝字子通，與峻同祖","src":"三國志·卷六十四 諸葛滕二孫濮陽傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷64"},"bq":{"s":"綝死時年二十八","src":"三國志·卷六十四 諸葛滕二孫濮陽傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷64"},"end":{"y":258,"how":"executed","zh":"廢亮立休，旋為休所誅","en":"deposed Liang for Xiu, who soon had him killed","by":[{"zh":"孫休","en":"Sun Xiu","id":"sun-xiu"}],"q":{"s":"夷綝三族，發孫峻棺，取其印綬，斫其木而埋之","src":"資治通鑑·卷77","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷077"}}}]},{"id":"liu-shu","zh":"劉氏（蜀漢）","en":"The Liu house (Shu Han)","group":"imperial","lineage":{"id":"liu","zh":"劉氏（漢室）","en":"The Liu (house of Han)"},"from":161,"to":271,"color":"#2e8b57","sum":{"zh":"涿郡劉備，自稱漢中山靖王之後，取荊、益，221年稱帝於成都。","en":"Liu Bei of Zhuo commandery, who claimed descent from Prince Jing of Zhongshan, took Jing and Yi provinces and made himself emperor at Chengdu in 221."},"fate":{"zh":"263年魏鄧艾入蜀，後主出降；北地王諶殺妻子而後自殺。次年鍾會之亂，太子璿被殺。後主遷洛陽，封安樂公，271年卒。","en":"In 263 Deng Ai of Wei entered Shu and the Later Lord surrendered; Liu Chen, Prince of Beidi, killed his wife and children and then himself. In the mutiny of Zhong Hui the next year the heir Liu Xuan was killed. The Later Lord was moved to Luoyang as Duke of Anle and died in 271."},"links":[{"family":"zhuge","zh":"輔政：諸葛氏。","en":"Ministers: the Zhuge."},{"family":"sima","zh":"亡於：魏（司馬氏執政）。","en":"Destroyed by: Wei, under the Sima."}],"members":[{"id":"liu-zhen-lc","zh":"劉貞","en":"Liu Zhen","title":{"zh":"陸城亭侯","en":"Marquis of Lucheng"},"p":"liu-sheng","seen":-116,"kin":{"s":"勝子貞，元狩六年封涿縣陸城亭侯，坐酎金失侯，因家焉","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"}},{"id":"liu-xiong","zh":"劉雄","en":"Liu Xiong","title":{"zh":"備之祖","en":"Liu Bei's grandfather"},"p":"liu-zhen-lc","far":{"zh":"後裔（其間世數史文不載）","en":"descendant (the generations between are not recorded)"},"gap":true,"kin":{"s":"先主祖雄，父弘，世仕州郡","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"}},{"id":"liu-hong-zhuo","zh":"劉弘","en":"Liu Hong","title":{"zh":"備之父","en":"Liu Bei's father"},"p":"liu-xiong","kin":{"s":"先主祖雄，父弘，世仕州郡","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"}},{"id":"sun-furen-l","zh":"孫夫人","en":"Lady Sun","title":{"zh":"孫權之妹，劉備夫人","en":"sister of Sun Quan, wife of Liu Bei"},"spouseOf":"liu-bei","female":true,"seen":214,"same":"sun-furen"},{"id":"gan-furen","zh":"甘夫人","en":"Lady Gan","title":{"zh":"昭烈皇后，後主之母","en":"Empress Zhaolie, mother of Liu Shan"},"spouseOf":"liu-bei","female":true,"kin":{"s":"先主甘皇后，沛人也","src":"三國志·卷三十四 二主妃子傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷34"}},{"id":"zhang-hou-s","zh":"張氏","en":"Lady Zhang","title":{"zh":"敬哀皇后，張飛長女","en":"Empress Jing'ai, eldest daughter of Zhang Fei"},"spouseOf":"liu-shan","female":true,"d":237,"kin":{"s":"後主敬哀皇后，車騎將軍張飛長女也","src":"三國志·卷三十四 二主妃子傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷34"}},{"id":"liu-bei","zh":"劉備","en":"Liu Bei","title":{"zh":"漢昭烈帝（先主）","en":"Emperor Zhaolie (the First Lord)"},"p":"liu-hong-zhuo","b":161,"d":223,"entity":"liu-bei","reign":[221,223],"n":1,"kin":{"s":"先主姓劉，諱備，字玄德，涿郡涿縣人，漢景帝子中山靖王勝之後也","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"},"kin2":{"s":"勝子貞，元狩六年封涿縣陸城亭侯，坐酎金失侯，因家焉","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"},"bq":{"s":"夏四月癸巳，先主殂於永安宮，時年六十三","src":"三國志·卷三十二 先主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷32"},"marks":[{"y":221,"zh":"以漢中王即皇帝位於武擔之南，改元章武","en":"King of Hanzhong, he takes the title of emperor south of Wudan","throne":"self","q":{"s":"夏，四月，丙午，漢中王即皇帝位於武擔之南，大赦，改元章武","src":"資治通鑑·卷69","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷069"}}],"end":{"y":223,"how":"natural","zh":"伐吳敗還，殂於永安","en":"died at Yong'an after his defeat against Wu","q":{"s":"漢主殂於永安","src":"資治通鑑·卷70","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷070"}}},{"id":"liu-feng","zh":"劉封","en":"Liu Feng","title":{"zh":"副軍將軍","en":"General"},"p":"liu-bei","adopted":true,"d":220,"end":{"y":220,"how":"forced","zh":"不救關羽，又失上庸；諸葛亮勸除之，賜死","en":"did not relieve Guan Yu and lost Shangyong; on Zhuge Liang's advice he was made to die","by":[{"zh":"劉備","en":"Liu Bei","entity":"liu-bei"},{"zh":"諸葛亮（勸）","en":"Zhuge Liang (who advised it)","entity":"zhuge-liang"}],"q":{"s":"諸葛亮慮封剛猛，易世之後，終難制御，勸漢中王因此際除之；遂賜封死","src":"資治通鑑·卷69","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷069"}}},{"id":"liu-shan","zh":"劉禪","en":"Liu Shan","title":{"zh":"後主","en":"the Later Lord"},"p":"liu-bei","b":207,"bstd":true,"d":271,"reign":[223,263],"n":2,"kin":{"s":"後主諱禪，字公嗣，先主子也","src":"三國志·卷三十三 後主傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷33"},"mo":{"zh":"甘皇后","en":"Lady Gan (later Empress)","id":"gan-furen","q":{"s":"隨先主於荊州，產後主","src":"三國志·卷三十四 二主妃子傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷34"}},"marks":[{"y":219,"zh":"立為王太子","en":"made heir to the kingdom","heir":"in","q":{"s":"立子禪為王太子","src":"資治通鑑·卷68","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷068"}},{"y":221,"zh":"立為皇太子","en":"made heir apparent","heir":"in","q":{"s":"立子禪為皇太子","src":"資治通鑑·卷69","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷069"}},{"y":263,"zh":"鄧艾至成都，出降，蜀漢亡","en":"Surrenders when Deng Ai reaches Chengdu; Shu Han is over","q":{"s":"漢主乃遣侍中張紹等奉璽綬以降於艾","src":"資治通鑑·卷78","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷078"}}],"end":{"y":271,"how":"natural","zh":"卒於洛陽（安樂公）","en":"died at Luoyang, as Duke of Anle","q":{"s":"是歳，安樂思公劉禪卒","src":"資治通鑑·卷79","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷079"}}},{"id":"liu-xuan","zh":"劉璿","en":"Liu Xuan","title":{"zh":"太子","en":"heir apparent"},"p":"liu-shan","d":264,"mo":{"zh":"王貴人","en":"Lady Wang","q":{"s":"母王貴人，本敬哀張皇后侍人也","src":"三國志·卷三十四 二主妃子傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷34"}},"marks":[{"y":238,"zh":"立為皇太子","en":"made heir apparent","heir":"in","q":{"s":"立王貴人子璿為皇太子，瑤為安定王","src":"資治通鑑·卷74","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷074"}}],"end":{"y":264,"how":"killed","zh":"鍾會之亂，為亂兵所殺","en":"killed by the soldiery in Zhong Hui's mutiny","q":{"s":"會將士死者數百人，殺漢太子璿及姜維妻子，軍眾鈔略，死喪狼藉","src":"資治通鑑·卷78","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷078"}}},{"id":"liu-chen","zh":"劉諶","en":"Liu Chen","title":{"zh":"北地王","en":"Prince of Beidi"},"p":"liu-shan","d":263,"end":{"y":263,"how":"suicide","zh":"諫降不聽，哭於昭烈之廟，先殺妻子，而後自殺","en":"argued against surrender in vain, wept in the temple of Zhaolie, killed his wife and children and then himself","q":{"s":"是日，諶哭於昭烈之廟，先殺妻子，而後自殺","src":"資治通鑑·卷78","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷078"}}}]},{"id":"cui-qinghe","zh":"清河崔氏","en":"The Cui of Qinghe","group":"minister","clan":true,"from":163,"to":450,"color":"#4a5a3a","sum":{"zh":"清河東武城崔氏。漢末崔琰為曹操所殺；從弟崔林為魏司空。北魏崔宏、崔浩父子為太祖、太宗、世祖謀主。","en":"The Cui of Dongwucheng in Qinghe. Cui Yan was put to death by Cao Cao; his cousin Cui Lin was Minister of Works of Wei. Under Northern Wei Cui Hong and his son Cui Hao were the chief counsellors of three emperors."},"fate":{"zh":"450年崔浩以國史之獄被誅，清河崔氏及姻親范陽盧氏、太原郭氏、河東柳氏皆族滅。","en":"In 450 Cui Hao was executed over the national history, and the Cui of Qinghe with their relations by marriage, the Lu of Fanyang, the Guo of Taiyuan and the Liu of Hedong, were destroyed with him."},"links":[{"family":"cao","zh":"所事／所殺：曹氏（魏）。","en":"Served, and killed by: the Cao (Wei)."},{"family":"tuoba","zh":"所事／所誅：拓跋氏（北魏）。","en":"Served, and destroyed by: the Tuoba (Northern Wei)."}],"members":[{"id":"cui-yan","zh":"崔琰","en":"Cui Yan","title":{"zh":"魏中尉","en":"Commandant under Cao Cao"},"b":163,"bstd":true,"d":216,"aka":["崔琰"],"kin":{"s":"崔琰字季珪，清河東武城人也","src":"三國志·卷十二 崔琰傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷12"}},{"id":"cui-lin","zh":"崔林","en":"Cui Lin","title":{"zh":"魏司空、安陽孝侯","en":"Minister of Works of Wei, Marquis Xiao of Anyang"},"p":"cui-yan","seen":237,"d":244,"aka":["崔林"],"far":{"zh":"從弟","en":"younger cousin"},"kin":{"s":"琰從弟林，少無名望，雖姻族猶多輕之，而琰常曰：『此所謂大器晚成者也，終必遠至","src":"三國志·卷十二 崔琰傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷12"},"end":{"y":244,"how":"natural","zh":"卒","en":"died","q":{"s":"安陽孝侯崔林卒","src":"資治通鑑·卷74","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷074"}}},{"id":"cui-hong","zh":"崔宏","en":"Cui Hong","title":{"zh":"魏白馬公（崔玄伯）","en":"Duke of Baima (Cui Xuanbo)"},"p":"cui-lin","seen":372,"d":418,"aka":["崔宏","崔玄伯"],"far":{"zh":"六世孫（《魏書》；其間各代不載）","en":"descendant in the 6th generation (Book of Wei; the generations between are not named)"},"gap":true,"kin":{"s":"崔玄伯，清河東武城人也，名犯高祖廟諱，魏司空林六世孫也","src":"魏書·卷二十四 崔玄伯傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/魏書/卷24"}},{"id":"cui-hao","zh":"崔浩","en":"Cui Hao","title":{"zh":"魏司徒","en":"Minister over the Masses of Wei"},"p":"cui-hong","b":381,"bstd":true,"d":450,"entity":"cui-hao","aka":["崔浩"],"kin":{"s":"崔浩，字伯淵，清河人也，白馬公玄伯之長子","src":"魏書·卷三十五 崔浩傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/魏書/卷35"}}]},{"id":"wang-taiyuan","zh":"太原王氏","en":"The Wang of Taiyuan","group":"minister","clan":true,"from":171,"to":440,"color":"#6a4a3a","sum":{"zh":"太原晉陽王氏。魏司空王昶之後：子王渾平吳有功，渾弟王湛一支在東晉為王述、王坦之、王國寶；其後王慧龍奔北魏，為北朝太原王氏之祖。","en":"The Wang of Jinyang in Taiyuan, from Wang Chang, Minister of Works of Wei: his son Wang Hun took part in the conquest of Wu; the line of Hun's brother Zhan gave Eastern Jin Wang Shu, Wang Tanzhi and Wang Guobao; later Wang Huilong fled to Northern Wei and became the forebear of the northern Wang of Taiyuan."},"fate":{"zh":"397年王國寶以專權為會稽王道子所殺；404年王愉謀襲劉裕，族誅，唯孫慧龍得免，奔後秦，再入北魏。","en":"In 397 Wang Guobao was put to death by the Prince of Kuaiji for his abuse of power; in 404 Wang Yu plotted against Liu Yu and his clan was executed, all but his grandson Huilong, who escaped to Later Qin and then to Northern Wei."},"links":[{"family":"sima","zh":"所事：司馬氏（晉）。","en":"Served: the Sima (Jin)."},{"family":"wang-langye","zh":"同姓異望：琅邪王氏。","en":"The other great Wang: of Langye."}],"members":[{"id":"wang-chang-ty","zh":"王昶","en":"Wang Chang","title":{"zh":"魏司空","en":"Minister of Works of Wei"},"seen":236,"d":259,"aka":["王昶"],"kin":{"s":"王昶字文舒，太原晉陽人也","src":"三國志·卷二十七 王昶傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷27"}},{"id":"wang-hun-ty","zh":"王渾","en":"Wang Hun","title":{"zh":"晉司徒、京陵元公","en":"Minister over the Masses of Jin, Duke Yuan of Jingling"},"p":"wang-chang-ty","b":223,"d":297,"aka":["王渾"],"kin":{"s":"父昶，魏司空","src":"晉書·卷四十二 王渾傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷042"},"bq":{"s":"元康七年薨，時年七十五，諡曰元","src":"晉書·卷四十二 王渾傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷042"},"end":{"y":297,"how":"natural","zh":"薨","en":"died","q":{"s":"丁丑，京陵元公王渾薨","src":"資治通鑑·卷82","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷082"}}},{"id":"wang-ji-ty","zh":"王濟","en":"Wang Ji","title":{"zh":"侍中，尚常山公主","en":"Palace Attendant, husband of a princess"},"p":"wang-hun-ty","kin":{"s":"長子尚早亡，次子濟嗣","src":"晉書·卷四十二 王渾傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷042"}},{"id":"wang-zhan","zh":"王湛","en":"Wang Zhan","title":{"zh":"汝南內史","en":"Administrator of Runan"},"p":"wang-chang-ty","b":249,"d":295,"kin":{"s":"王湛，字處沖，司徒渾之弟也","src":"晉書·卷七十五 王湛傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷075"},"bq":{"s":"元康五年卒，年四十七","src":"晉書·卷七十五 王湛傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷075"}},{"id":"wang-cheng-ty","zh":"王承","en":"Wang Cheng","title":{"zh":"東海內史","en":"Administrator of Donghai"},"p":"wang-zhan","kin":{"s":"子承嗣","src":"晉書·卷七十五 王湛傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷075"}},{"id":"wang-shu-ty","zh":"王述","en":"Wang Shu","title":{"zh":"尚書令、藍田侯","en":"Director of the Secretariat, Marquis of Lantian"},"p":"wang-cheng-ty","b":303,"d":368,"kin":{"s":"子述嗣","src":"晉書·卷七十五 王湛傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷075"},"bq":{"s":"三年卒，時年六十六","src":"晉書·卷七十五 王湛傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷075"}},{"id":"wang-tanzhi","zh":"王坦之","en":"Wang Tanzhi","title":{"zh":"中書令、藍田獻侯","en":"Director of the Secretariat, Marquis Xian of Lantian"},"p":"wang-shu-ty","b":330,"bstd":true,"d":375,"aka":["王坦之"],"end":{"y":375,"how":"natural","zh":"卒","en":"died","q":{"s":"藍田獻侯王坦之卒","src":"資治通鑑·卷103","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷103"}}},{"id":"wang-yu-ty","zh":"王愉","en":"Wang Yu","title":{"zh":"尚書左僕射","en":"Vice Director of the Secretariat"},"p":"wang-tanzhi","seen":398,"d":404,"aka":["王愉"],"end":{"y":404,"how":"executed","zh":"謀襲劉裕，事洩，族誅","en":"plotted to surprise Liu Yu; found out, he and his clan were executed","by":[{"zh":"劉裕","en":"Liu Yu","entity":"liu-yu"}],"q":{"s":"尚書左僕射王愉及子荊州刺史綏謀襲裕，事洩，族誅","src":"資治通鑑·卷113","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷113"}}},{"id":"wang-guobao","zh":"王國寶","en":"Wang Guobao","title":{"zh":"中書令","en":"Director of the Secretariat"},"p":"wang-tanzhi","seen":383,"d":397,"aka":["王國寶","國寶"]},{"id":"wang-ji-jz","zh":"王緝","en":"Wang Ji (緝)","title":{"zh":"散騎侍郎","en":"gentleman cavalier"},"p":"wang-yu-ty","d":404},{"id":"wang-huilong","zh":"王慧龍","en":"Wang Huilong","title":{"zh":"魏寧南將軍","en":"General Ningnan of Wei"},"p":"wang-ji-jz","b":390,"bstd":true,"d":440,"aka":["王慧龍"],"far":{"zh":"子（自云）","en":"son (by his own account)"},"gap":true,"kin":{"s":"王慧龍，自云太原晉陽人，司馬德宗尚書僕射愉之孫，散騎侍郎緝之子也","src":"魏書·卷三十八 王慧龍傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/魏書/卷38"},"end":{"y":440,"how":"natural","zh":"卒","en":"died","q":{"s":"魏寧南將軍王慧龍卒","src":"資治通鑑·卷123","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷123"}}},{"id":"wang-baoxing","zh":"王寶興","en":"Wang Baoxing","title":{"zh":"襲長社侯","en":"Marquis of Changshe"},"p":"wang-huilong","kin":{"s":"子寶興襲爵","src":"魏書·卷三十八 王慧龍傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/魏書/卷38"}}]},{"id":"zhuge","zh":"諸葛氏（琅邪）","en":"The Zhuge family (of Langye)","group":"minister","clan":true,"from":174,"to":263,"color":"#1f7a8a","sum":{"zh":"琅邪陽都諸葛氏，漢末分仕三國：諸葛瑾仕吳為大將軍，弟亮為蜀漢丞相，族人誕仕魏為征東大將軍。","en":"The Zhuge of Yangdu in Langye served all three kingdoms: Zhuge Jin was general-in-chief in Wu, his brother Liang chancellor of Shu Han, and their kinsman Dan a general of Wei."},"fate":{"zh":"吳：諸葛恪輔政，253年為孫峻所殺，夷三族。魏：諸葛誕據壽春反司馬昭，258年兵敗被斬，夷三族。蜀：諸葛瞻與子尚263年戰死綿竹。","en":"In Wu, Zhuge Ke governed and was killed by Sun Jun in 253, his kin destroyed to the third degree. In Wei, Zhuge Dan rose at Shouchun against Sima Zhao, was beaten and beheaded in 258, his kin destroyed likewise. In Shu, Zhuge Zhan and his son Shang fell in battle at Mianzhu in 263."},"links":[{"family":"liu-shu","zh":"所事：劉氏（蜀漢）。","en":"Served: the Liu (Shu Han)."},{"family":"sun-wu","zh":"所事：孫氏（吳）。","en":"Served: the Sun (Wu)."}],"members":[{"id":"zhuge-gui","zh":"諸葛珪","en":"Zhuge Gui","title":{"zh":"太山郡丞","en":"Assistant of Taishan commandery"}},{"id":"zhuge-jin","zh":"諸葛瑾","en":"Zhuge Jin","title":{"zh":"吳大將軍","en":"General-in-Chief of Wu"},"p":"zhuge-gui","b":174,"bstd":true,"d":241,"kin":{"s":"喬字伯松，亮兄瑾之第二子也，本字仲慎","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"},"end":{"y":241,"how":"natural","zh":"卒","en":"died","q":{"s":"閏月，吳大將軍諸葛瑾卒","src":"資治通鑑·卷74","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷074"}}},{"id":"zhuge-liang","zh":"諸葛亮","en":"Zhuge Liang","title":{"zh":"蜀漢丞相","en":"Chancellor of Shu Han"},"p":"zhuge-gui","b":181,"d":234,"entity":"zhuge-liang","kin":{"s":"父圭，字君貢，漢末為太山郡丞","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"},"bq":{"s":"其年八月，亮疾病，卒于軍，時年五十四","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"},"end":{"y":234,"how":"natural","zh":"北伐，卒於五丈原軍中","en":"died in camp at Wuzhang Plain on his northern campaign","q":{"s":"是月，亮卒於軍中","src":"資治通鑑·卷72","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷072"}}},{"id":"zhuge-ke","zh":"諸葛恪","en":"Zhuge Ke","title":{"zh":"吳太傅","en":"Grand Tutor of Wu"},"p":"zhuge-jin","b":203,"bstd":true,"d":253,"entity":"zhuge-ke","kin":{"s":"諸葛恪字元遜，瑾長子也","src":"三國志·卷六十四 諸葛滕二孫濮陽傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷64"},"end":{"y":253,"how":"killed","zh":"伐魏新城敗還，孫峻與吳主亮謀，於宴上殺之，夷三族","en":"back from his failed siege of Xincheng, cut down at a banquet by Sun Jun with the young ruler's consent, and his kin destroyed","by":[{"zh":"孫峻","en":"Sun Jun","id":"sun-jun"}],"q":{"s":"武衛之士皆趨上殿，峻曰：「所取者恪也，今已死","src":"資治通鑑·卷76","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷076"}}},{"id":"zhuge-qiao","zh":"諸葛喬","en":"Zhuge Qiao","title":{"zh":"過繼諸葛亮","en":"adopted by Zhuge Liang"},"p":"zhuge-jin","b":204,"bstd":true,"d":228,"kin":{"s":"喬字伯松，亮兄瑾之第二子也，本字仲慎","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"}},{"id":"zhuge-zhan","zh":"諸葛瞻","en":"Zhuge Zhan","title":{"zh":"蜀漢衞將軍","en":"General of the Guards of Shu Han"},"p":"zhuge-liang","b":227,"d":263,"kin":{"s":"亮子瞻，嗣爵","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"},"bq":{"s":"遂戰，大敗，臨陣死，時年三十七","src":"三國志·卷三十五 諸葛亮傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷35"},"end":{"y":263,"how":"killed","zh":"拒鄧艾於綿竹，戰死","en":"fell in battle against Deng Ai at Mianzhu","by":[{"zh":"鄧艾軍","en":"Deng Ai's army"}],"q":{"s":"忠、纂馳還更戰，大破，斬瞻及黃崇","src":"資治通鑑·卷78","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷078"}}},{"id":"zhuge-shang","zh":"諸葛尚","en":"Zhuge Shang","p":"zhuge-zhan","d":263,"end":{"y":263,"how":"killed","zh":"與父同戰死綿竹","en":"fell with his father at Mianzhu","by":[{"zh":"鄧艾軍","en":"Deng Ai's army"}],"q":{"s":"策馬冒陣而死","src":"資治通鑑·卷78","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷078"}}},{"id":"zhuge-dan","zh":"諸葛誕","en":"Zhuge Dan","title":{"zh":"魏征東大將軍","en":"General Who Subdues the East, of Wei"},"seen":230,"d":258,"far":{"zh":"同族（諸葛豐之後）","en":"of the same clan (descended from Zhuge Feng)"},"kin":{"s":"諸葛誕字公休，琅邪陽都人，諸葛豐後也","src":"三國志·卷二十八 王毌丘諸葛鄧鍾傳","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三國志/卷28"},"end":{"y":258,"how":"killed","zh":"據壽春反司馬昭，城破被斬，夷三族","en":"rose at Shouchun against Sima Zhao; cut down when the city fell, and his kin destroyed to the third degree","by":[{"zh":"司馬昭","en":"Sima Zhao","id":"sima-zhao"}],"q":{"s":"誕窘急，單馬將其麾下突小城欲出，司馬胡奮部兵擊斬之，夷其三族","src":"資治通鑑·卷77","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷077"}}}]},{"id":"sima","zh":"司馬氏（晉）","en":"The Sima house (Jin)","group":"imperial","from":179,"to":421,"color":"#7a4a9a","sum":{"zh":"河內溫縣司馬氏。司馬懿及其子師、昭相繼執魏政：249年誅曹爽，254年廢魏帝芳，260年魏帝髦為其黨所弒。265年司馬炎受魏禪稱帝，是為晉。","en":"The Sima of Wen county in Henei. Sima Yi and his sons Shi and Zhao held power in Wei one after another: Cao Shuang was destroyed in 249, the Wei emperor Fang deposed in 254, the Wei emperor Mao killed by their party in 260. In 265 Sima Yan received the abdication of Wei and reigned as emperor of Jin."},"fate":{"zh":"武帝死後，宗室諸王相殺（八王之亂），懷、愍二帝被俘至平陽，為劉聰所殺。元帝在建康重建晉室，傳十一帝；安帝、恭帝皆為劉裕所殺，420年恭帝禪位於宋。","en":"After Emperor Wu the princes of the house killed one another (the War of the Eight Princes), and the emperors Huai and Min were carried to Pingyang and killed by Liu Cong. Emperor Yuan re-founded Jin at Jiankang, where eleven emperors reigned; the last two, An and Gong, were both killed by Liu Yu, to whom Gong gave up the throne in 420."},"links":[{"family":"cao","zh":"前：曹氏（魏）。司馬氏三世為魏臣，265年受魏禪。","en":"Before: the Cao house (Wei). The Sima served Wei for three generations and took its throne in 265."},{"entity":"liu-yu","zh":"後：劉裕（宋）。晉將，420年受晉禪，421年殺恭帝。","en":"After: Liu Yu (Song), a general of Jin, who took the throne in 420 and had Emperor Gong killed in 421."}],"members":[{"id":"sima-ang","zh":"司馬卬","en":"Sima Ang","title":{"zh":"趙將，項羽立為殷王","en":"general of Zhao, made King of Yin by Xiang Yu"},"seen":-206,"aka":["司馬卬"],"kin":{"s":"楚漢間，司馬卬為趙將，與諸侯伐秦","src":"晉書·卷一 宣帝紀","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷001"}},{"id":"sima-jun","zh":"司馬鈞","en":"Sima Jun","title":{"zh":"征西將軍","en":"General Who Subdues the West"},"p":"sima-ang","far":{"zh":"八世之後（《晉書》：「自卬八世」，其間各代不載）","en":"eight generations on (so the Book of Jin; the generations between are not named)"},"gap":true,"kin":{"s":"自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞，字叔平","src":"晉書·卷一 宣帝紀","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷001"}},{"id":"sima-liang-gd","zh":"司馬量","en":"Sima Liang","title":{"zh":"豫章太守","en":"Administrator of Yuzhang"},"p":"sima-jun","kin":{"s":"鈞生豫章太守量，字公度","src":"晉書·卷一 宣帝紀","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晉書/卷001"}},{"id":"sima-jun-yy","zh":"司馬儁","en":"Sima Jun","title":{"zh":"潁川太守","en":"Administrator of Yingchuan"},"p":"sima-liang-gd","kin":{"s":"量生潁川太守儁，字元異","src":"晉書·卷一 宣帝紀","u